    "updated_at": "2021-01-06T11:48:01Z",
    "body": "Hi @joe733, a quick way you can debug this is by enabling verbose logging, which can be done using the `STARSHIP_LOG` env var. If you run the following command it should give you the verbose logs for the whole prompt `STARSHIP_LOG=trace starship prompt` or you could try `STARSHIP_LOG=trace starship module conda` to get just the logs from the conda module.\r\n\r\nFrom looking at the source code the conda module depends on the `CONDA_DEFAULT_ENV` env var so another thing you could try is seeing if that is set e.g `echo $CONDA_DEFAULT_ENV`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
