    "updated_at": "2021-01-11T18:22:19Z",
    "body": "Thanks, got it working!\r\n\r\nRan `STARSHIP_LOG=trace starship module conda`\r\n\r\n```bash\r\njoe733 @ xpsl502x in ~ \r\n➜ STARSHIP_LOG=trace starship module conda\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): STARSHIP_CONFIG is not set\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Using default config path: /home/joe733/.config/starship.toml\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Config file content: \"\r\n# format = \"$all\"\r\n\r\n[character]\r\nsuccess_symbol = \"[➜](bold green)\"\r\nerror_symbol = \"[➜](bold red)\"\r\n\r\n[username]\r\nformat = \"[$user](bold #ffcc66) @ \"\r\nshow_always = true\r\n\r\n[hostname]\r\nformat = \"[$hostname](bold #ff9933) in \"\r\nssh_only = false\r\n\r\n[python]\r\npyenv_version_name = true\r\n\"\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Config parsed: Table({\"character\": Table({\"success_symbol\": String(\"[➜](bold green)\"), \"error_symbol\": String(\"[➜](bold red)\")}), \"username\": Table({\"format\": String(\"[$user](bold #ffcc66) @ \"), \"show_always\": Boolean(true)}), \"hostname\": Table({\"format\": String(\"[$hostname](bold #ff9933) in \"), \"ssh_only\": Boolean(false)}), \"python\": Table({\"pyenv_version_name\": Boolean(true)})})\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): No config found for \"conda\": Option \"conda\" not found\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 123.107µs to compute module \"conda\"\r\n\r\njoe733 @ xpsl502x in ~ \r\n➜ conda activate base\r\n\r\njoe733 @ xpsl502x in ~ \r\n➜ echo $CONDA_DEFAULT_ENV\r\nbase\r\n```\r\n\r\nSeems fine. Changed the `.toml` file.. to add `[conda]` config\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n...\r\n\r\n[conda]\r\nignore_base = false\r\n```\r\n\r\n... and it worked!\r\n\r\n```\r\njoe733 @ xpsl502x in ~ via 🅒 base took 26s\r\n➜ \r\n```\r\n\r\nI need to read [docs](https://starship.rs/config/#conda) properly 🤦🏻‍♂️ 😄.\r\n\r\nClosing. Thanks anyway!",
